{"seq":2,"slug":"leverage-mortgage","title":"杠杆与抵押贷款","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-finance-investing/real-estate-investing/valuation/leverage-mortgage","wordCount":1663,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"杠杆与抵押贷款\">杠杆与抵押贷款</h1><p>房地产能让普通人致富，靠的不是房子本身的回报率——那点回报率其实平庸——而是杠杆。一个白领攒下 5 万美元，若全投股票，涨 8% 只赚 4000;同样这 5 万作首付控制一套 25 万的房子，房价涨 8%（即 2 万），相对自有资金的回报却是 40%。这就是杠杆的魔法。但同一根杠杆，房价跌 8% 时也会让你的股权缩水 40%，月供却分文不少。本篇是 hub 里杠杆与抵押贷款的主讲篇，把这把双刃剑的数学讲清楚，让你知道它何时是引擎、何时是绞索。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-杠杆如何放大股权回报\">核心概念：杠杆如何放大股权回报</h2><p>杠杆的本质是用别人（银行）的低成本资金，去博取资产的整体回报，差额归你。关键的三个量是贷款价值比（LTV）、利率、和摊还结构。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[购房总价 V] --&gt; B[首付 Equity]&#10;    A --&gt; C[贷款 Debt]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[LTV = 贷款 / 总价]&#10;    C --&gt; D[月供 = 本金摊还 + 利息]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[本金部分 转为你的股权]&#10;    D --&gt; D2[利息部分 是资金成本]&#10;    B --&gt; E[股权回报被资产回报放大]&#10;    C1 --&gt; E&#10;    D1 --&gt; F[本金摊还&lt;br/&gt;第三个收益来源]&#10;    F --&gt; E\">flowchart TD\n    A[购房总价 V] --&gt; B[首付 Equity]\n    A --&gt; C[贷款 Debt]\n    C --&gt; C1[LTV = 贷款 / 总价]\n    C --&gt; D[月供 = 本金摊还 + 利息]\n    D --&gt; D1[本金部分 转为你的股权]\n    D --&gt; D2[利息部分 是资金成本]\n    B --&gt; E[股权回报被资产回报放大]\n    C1 --&gt; E\n    D1 --&gt; F[本金摊还&lt;br/&gt;第三个收益来源]\n    F --&gt; E</pre><p>这里要把杠杆与前后篇严格分工：杠杆产生的「本金摊还」是 <a href=\"../fundamentals/cashflow-appreciation\">现金流与增值逻辑</a> 点名的第四个收益来源，本篇负责讲清它的机制；而杠杆后的具体回报率（CoC、IRR）由 <a href=\"return-metrics\">投资回报指标 IRR/CoC</a> 主讲；NOI 和月供如何配合算出现金流，则承接自 <a href=\"cashflow-cap-rate\">现金流量与 Cap Rate</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"贷款价值比-ltv-与首付\">贷款价值比 LTV 与首付</h2><p>LTV 衡量你借了多少：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>LTV</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>贷款额</mtext><mtext>房产价值</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{LTV} = \\frac{\\text{贷款额}}{\\text{房产价值}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">LTV</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2173em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8723em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">房产价值</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">贷款额</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>。它直接决定首付（首付比例 = 1 − LTV）和杠杆倍数。LTV 越高，杠杆越大，潜在回报与风险同步放大。</p>\n<p>不同用途的房产，银行给的 LTV 差别很大。截至 2026 年，自住房可做到 80%–97% LTV（首付低至 3%），而投资房通常被压到 75%–80%（首付 20%–25%），且利率更高。这是因为银行认为投资者在困难时会先违约投资房、保住自住房，风险更大。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>房产用途</th>\n<th>典型 LTV</th>\n<th>首付</th>\n<th>利率（2026 中）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>自住主房</td>\n<td>80%–97%</td>\n<td>3%–20%</td>\n<td>~6.3%–6.4%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>投资房（住宅）</td>\n<td>75%–80%</td>\n<td>20%–25%</td>\n<td>~7%–8%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>商业地产</td>\n<td>65%–75%</td>\n<td>25%–35%</td>\n<td>视项目而定</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>2026 年中，30 年期固定自住房贷利率约 6.3%–6.4%，投资房通常再高 0.5–1.5 个百分点落在 7%–8%（<a href=\"https://money.usnews.com/loans/mortgages/mortgage-rate-forecast\">U.S. News 2026 房贷预测</a>）。利率每升一个百分点，月供与盈亏平衡点都上移，这是 2026 年加杠杆必须正视的现实。</p>\n<h2 id=\"摊还的数学-月供与本金的此消彼长\">摊还的数学：月供与本金的此消彼长</h2><p>固定利率贷款的月供由摊还公式决定。设贷款本金 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span>、月利率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span>（年利率除以 12）、总期数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>（年数乘 12），则每月还款额为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M = P \\cdot \\frac{r(1+r)^n}{(1+r)^n - 1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5904em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>月供 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span> 在整个贷款期保持不变，但它内部的「利息」与「本金」比例随时间反转。还款早期绝大部分是利息，本金还得很少；越往后本金占比越高。这就是为什么持有前几年「本金摊还」这个收益来源贡献微薄，而长期持有才能享受租客帮你大量还本的红利。</p>\n<p>举例：借 24 万美元、利率 7.5%、30 年期，月供约 1678 美元。第一个月里约 1500 美元是利息，仅约 178 美元还本；到第 20 年，本金部分才超过利息。理解这条曲线，能帮你判断「持有多久才划算」——短期持有几乎享受不到本金摊还的好处，这也是 <a href=\"../strategies/buy-and-hold\">出租持有与现金流</a> 强调长期持有的财务依据之一。</p>\n<h2 id=\"正杠杆与负杠杆-分水岭在哪\">正杠杆与负杠杆：分水岭在哪</h2><p>杠杆不总是朋友。它是敌是友，取决于资产回报率与借贷成本的高低对比。</p>\n<p>当资产的无杠杆回报（约等于 Cap Rate）<strong>高于</strong>贷款利率时，是<strong>正杠杆</strong>——借得越多，股权回报越高，杠杆是引擎。当 Cap Rate <strong>低于</strong>贷款利率时，是<strong>负杠杆</strong>——你借来的钱赚的还不够付利息，借得越多亏得越多，杠杆是绞索。</p>\n<p>2026 年这个分水岭尤其值得警惕：住宅 Cap Rate 普遍在 4%–7%，而投资房贷利率高达 7%–8%。这意味着在许多市场，加杠杆已经处于<strong>负杠杆区间</strong>——单看现金流，房子可能要倒贴月供。此时投资者实际上是在押注增值和本金摊还来弥补现金流的亏空，风险显著上升。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>情形</th>\n<th>Cap Rate vs 利率</th>\n<th>杠杆效果</th>\n<th>2026 现实</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>正杠杆</td>\n<td>Cap Rate &gt; 利率</td>\n<td>放大正回报</td>\n<td>仅高 Cap Rate 蓝领市场可达</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中性</td>\n<td>Cap Rate ≈ 利率</td>\n<td>杠杆不增不减回报</td>\n<td>部分平衡市场</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>负杠杆</td>\n<td>Cap Rate &lt; 利率</td>\n<td>放大亏损</td>\n<td>多数核心城市当前所处</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>判断自己处在哪个区间，要把 Cap Rate（<a href=\"cashflow-cap-rate\">现金流量与 Cap Rate</a>）和贷款利率直接相减，这是加杠杆前的第一道安检。</p>\n<h2 id=\"杠杆风险与偿债能力指标\">杠杆风险与偿债能力指标</h2><p>放贷机构和审慎的投资者都用偿债覆盖率（DSCR）来守住杠杆的下限：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>DSCR</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>N</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>I</mi></mrow><mtext>年还本付息额</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{DSCR} = \\frac{NOI}{\\text{年还本付息额}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">DSCR</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2173em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8723em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">年还本付息额</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>。DSCR 大于 1 表示租金净收益足以覆盖月供，银行通常要求商业贷款 DSCR ≥ 1.2–1.25，即留出 20%–25% 的安全垫。DSCR 低于 1 意味着房子无法自养，你得每月从工资里补贴月供——这是杠杆从引擎变绞索的危险信号。</p>\n<p>杠杆的另一重风险是再融资风险与利率重置风险：若你用的是浮动利率或短期气球贷（balloon loan），到期需再融资时若利率走高或房价下跌（LTV 被动升高），可能借不到足够的钱续上，被迫贱卖。如何为这些情形预设缓冲与退出方案，是 <a href=\"../operations-risk/risk-exit\">风险管理与退出</a> 的核心议题。守住杠杆纪律——足够的 DSCR 安全垫、固定利率优先、留足现金储备——是房地产投资能穿越周期的前提。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>杠杆用银行低成本资金博取资产整体回报，差额归你，从而放大股权回报——但下跌时同样放大亏损。</li>\n<li>LTV 决定杠杆倍数；2026 年投资房 LTV 约 75%–80%、利率 7%–8%，明显高于自住房。</li>\n<li>摊还公式 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M = P \\cdot \\frac{r(1+r)^n}{(1+r)^n-1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.53em;vertical-align:-0.52em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.01em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\"><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5935em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.786em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.485em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\"><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7385em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.931em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.52em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span> 给出固定月供；早期还利息为主、后期还本为主，故本金摊还红利偏向长期持有者。</li>\n<li>正杠杆（Cap Rate &gt; 利率）放大回报，负杠杆（Cap Rate &lt; 利率）放大亏损；2026 年多数核心城市已落入负杠杆区间。</li>\n<li>用 DSCR（NOI / 年还本付息）守住下限，商业贷款常要求 ≥ 1.2–1.25；警惕浮动利率与气球贷的再融资风险。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"杠杆与抵押贷款","id":"杠杆与抵押贷款"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：杠杆如何放大股权回报","id":"核心概念-杠杆如何放大股权回报"},{"level":2,"text":"贷款价值比 LTV 与首付","id":"贷款价值比-ltv-与首付"},{"level":2,"text":"摊还的数学：月供与本金的此消彼长","id":"摊还的数学-月供与本金的此消彼长"},{"level":2,"text":"正杠杆与负杠杆：分水岭在哪","id":"正杠杆与负杠杆-分水岭在哪"},{"level":2,"text":"杠杆风险与偿债能力指标","id":"杠杆风险与偿债能力指标"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"现金流量与 Cap Rate","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-finance-investing/real-estate-investing/valuation/cashflow-cap-rate"},"next":{"title":"投资回报指标 IRR/CoC","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-finance-investing/real-estate-investing/valuation/return-metrics"}}